 \tab\tab required to create binary output).\par
\par
\tab\tab Note: If the virtual loader is in effect, the /I option \tab\tab\tab switch is ignored; the restriction on maximum binary input \tab\tab\tab files does not apply.  If the hardware-dependent Slurp\i\par
